<center><table border=0 width=95% cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 bgcolor=#FFFFFF>
<tr><td>
<table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=6 bgcolor=#DCDCDC><tr>
<td>[<b>45</b>] <font color=#006400><b>Hangetu3のItemの品々（第２回）その１</b></font></td>
<td width=10>　</td><td>投稿者：<font color=#0000FF><b>Mafura@Brd</b></font></td>
<td align=right>　<small>投稿日：2002/05/06(Mon) 10:29:03</small></td></tr></table>
<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="FF80C0"><br>第１回のItemをまだ受け取ってない人もいますが、第２回開催ｗ<br>２回目なので本当に欲しいItemは無い気味？ｗ<br><br>対象：Hangetu3にお世話になった人ｗ<br><br>※その１，その２どちらか１回だけ振って下さい。<br><br>[1] Oakleaf Girdle<br>    (WAIST:AC 4,HP+40,MANA+40:ALL/ALL)<br><br>[2] Cloak of the Ice Bear<br>    (BACK:AC 8,HP+10,SVC+20:ALL/ALL)<br><br>[3] Student's Homework<br>    (RANGE:INT+3,MANA+15,SVM+10:CASTER)<br><br>[4] Froglok Bonecaster's Robe<br>    (CHEST:AC 10,STR+8,MANA+40,SVF+10,SVM+10:CASTER)<br><br>[5] Blue Diamind Electrum Earring<br>    (EAR:MANA+15,SVFC+6,SVM+4,SVPD+11:ALL/ALL)<br><br>[6] Diamond Electrum Mask<br>    (FACE:SVFC+5,SVM+3,SVPD+10:ALL/ALL)<br><br>[7] Golden Blue Diamond Pendant<br>    (NECK:MANA+20,SVFC+11,SVPD+6,SVM+4:ALL/ALL)<br><br>[8] Green Silken Drape<br>    (CHEST:AC 8,DEX+9,STA+9,INT+3,SVP+15:CASTER)<br><br>[9] Crushed Flame Opal<br><br>[10] Flawed Topaz<br></font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
 <font color=#008000>[03] Benkey：22</font><br>
 <font color=#8B008B>[04] Selline：45</font><br>
 <font color=#00CED1>[07] Mafura@Brd：24</font><br>
</font></td></tr></table>
